    <briefdescription>
<para>Link Layer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Commands and events in this class provide access to low-level Bluetooth link layer functionality that is not available via higher-level APIs of the Bluetooth host stack. This class is available when the bluetooth_feature_linklayer_interface component is included in the application. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
